5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Let's be pragmatic. I want to see how previous projects have actually aged before we trust new drawings.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree. I'm worried about the actual construction phase and whether the local firms can deliver on time.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mio,,I want to know how much this will cost us to keep up! We can't just build it and forget it.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I'm interested in the staffing. Who is actually going to maintain the site day-to-day?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,We need to understand how the public actually uses the space and how the land handles the weather.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Misaki, perhaps we should also look at the earth-moving tenders to see the risks involved?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"That's a good idea, Benjamin. I'll take a look at those and the phasing notes.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mio,,I'll check the upkeep ledger and the groundskeeping roll to see the money and the people.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Asuka,,I'll look into the volunteer groups and the groundskeeping roll as well.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,I'll focus on the weekday crossings and the drainage callouts.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I'll stick with the condition of earlier works and the eastern avenue planting records.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
