56,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The candidates are Market Plaza, Woodland Walk, Wetland Restoration, and Sports Terraces.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"Given the clay subsoil and slippage, the Woodland Walk or Plaza seem safest.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Mio,,Market Plaza is the clear winner for long-term maintenance costs.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Sports Terraces align best with our available volunteer support.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,1,talk,Minako,,Wetland Restoration is the only one that solves the drainage and heat issues.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, the earlier overflow basin worked well. That supports the Wetland plan.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Misaki,,But the earth-moving risks are real. A plaza is low-impact.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka, would sports courts be cheaper to maintain than a plaza?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"Probably not, but the volunteer support for the youth league is a huge asset.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Minako,,"@Misaki, the plaza would just increase the heat and runoff problems.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,I'll vote for the Wetland Restoration. It's the most logical long-term environmental fix.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Misaki,,I'll go with the Market Plaza. It's the lowest risk for delivery and stability.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Mio,,I have to vote Market Plaza. The upkeep costs for the others are too high.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Asuka,,I'm voting Sports Terraces. We have the people to run it.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Minako,,I'm voting Wetland Restoration. It's the only one that fits the land's behavior.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,It's a split house.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
